	<digest>
		Anti-aliased soft clipping function
	</digest>
	<description>
		<b>evi.softclip~</b> is a 'max define' for the <o>evi_softclip</o>.gendsp gen~ abstraction.
		Because evi.softclip~ is a 'max define' it also accepts all messages and attributes that a <o>gen~</o> object does. <br />
		<br />
		A quick all purpose and efficient soft clipper. <o>evi.softclip~</o> does not have all the options of <o>evi.hardclip~</o> or <o>evi.clip~</o>. It aims to be an easy <o>tanh~</o> replacement to drop in to audio chains. The algorithm is a 2nd order antiderivative antialiasing tanh-like function. At high input gains the behaviour is less tanh-like as it folds. <br />
	</description>
